# Stalemate in Time Line Fragment after six turns (ten moves), found with a random-playout search over the engine
# (an exhaustive search is out of reach here: time travel makes the tree explode). Moves (squares as drawn: file a on the left,
# White at the bottom; "T n" is the half-turn of the board the move is made on):
#   1. W  a1-a2 (timeline 1)                          2. B  b4xb1 (tl 1), c4-c3 (tl 0)
#   3. W  a2-a3 (tl 1), b1xb4 (tl 0)                  4. B  d4-d3 (tl 0), b1-b3 (tl 1)
#   5. W  knight d1xc3 (tl 0), pawn a3 -> a3 of tl 0   6. B  bishop c4 (tl 1, T 5) back to c3 of T 3 (forks)
# White then has no legal turn and is not in check: "Draw" (Stalemate).
# Squares are clicked by name (`clicksq <timeline> <half-turn> <square>`), see game-standard.ui; the waits let the camera
# settle after every move (it refits as boards are added).
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); mode row 8 (905,584 after scrolling the list to its end); Play (808,712); Submit (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
move 905 400
wheel -4             # the list scrolls to its end: the last two rows come into view
wait 10
click 905 584        # Misc - Time Line Fragment (row 8)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
# turn 1 (White)
clicksq 1 0 a1
wait 40
clicksq 1 0 a2
wait 40
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
# turn 2 (Black)
clicksq 1 1 b4
wait 40
clicksq 1 1 b1
wait 90
clicksq 0 1 c4
wait 40
clicksq 0 1 c3
wait 90
click 841 90
wait 90
# turn 3 (White)
clicksq 1 2 a2
wait 40
clicksq 1 2 a3
wait 90
clicksq 0 2 b1
wait 40
clicksq 0 2 b4
wait 90
click 841 90
wait 90
# turn 4 (Black)
clicksq 0 3 d4
wait 40
clicksq 0 3 d3
wait 90
clicksq 1 3 b1
wait 40
clicksq 1 3 b3
wait 90
click 841 90
wait 90
# turn 5 (White)
clicksq 0 4 d1
wait 40
clicksq 0 4 c3
wait 90
clicksq 1 4 a3
wait 40
clicksq 0 4 a3
wait 90
click 841 90
wait 90
# turn 6 (Black): the bishop travels back in time, creating a timeline
clicksq 1 5 c4
wait 40
clicksq 1 3 c3
wait 90
capture stalemate-last-move
click 841 90         # Submit: White has no legal turn and is not in check
wait 150
capture stalemate-end-card
